      "source": [
        "- foward algoritm \n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\left\\{\n",
        "\\begin{aligned}\n",
        "& \\alpha(z_1) = P(x_1 \\mid z_1)\\, P(z_1) \\\\\n",
        "& \\alpha(z_n) = P(x_n \\mid z_n)\\, \\sum_{z_{n-1}} P(z_{n} \\mid z_{n-1}) \\,\\alpha(z_{n-1})\n",
        "\\end{aligned}\n",
        "\\right.\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Prediction"
      ],
